    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d348">

                <pb facs="0460" n="364" sameAs="frus:frus1899/pg364"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr. Beaupre.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-03-01"><hi rendition="#italic">March 1,
                        1899</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>If reasonable grounds of suspicion you will not oppose action of Government of
                    Guatemala in refusing landing of alleged filibusters.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hay.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
